{
 "header": {
  "probe": "Q27",
  "question": "Q27: what does SetTestSignalFrequency take, and which frequencies does Commander keep? The vendor says Hertz [vendor: PDF p.28], but on 2026-10-23 Commander kept 2 Hz for every frequency ommm sent, and this probe's first run (40ed18a, raw values) showed the setter takes the period in seconds while the getter reads Hz; Commander._set now sends the period. Seal Test Frequency (V-Clamp) and then Tuning Frequency (I-Clamp) are set to frequencies in Hz on and off a 1-2-5 series and outside 2-1000 Hz, each read back, with a screenshot of the V-Clamp tab after each; then put back.",
  "time": "2026-10-23T13:33:09.962886-04:00",
  "setup": "amplifier on, a model cell on the headstage, its switch at CELL (--model-cell CELL)",
  "commander": "2.2.2.2",
